{"id":44037,"mal_id":44037,"anizone_id":44037,"url":"https://anizone.co.il/anime/44037/Banished-From-The-Heros-Party-I-Decided-To-Live-A-Quiet-Life-In-The-Countryside","slug":"Banished-From-The-Heros-Party-I-Decided-To-Live-A-Quiet-Life-In-The-Countryside","titles":{"hebrew":"גורשתי מקבוצת הגיבורים החלטתי לחיות חיים שקטים בכפר","english":"Banished From The Hero's Party, I Decided To Live A Quiet Life In The Countryside","romaji":"Shin no Nakama ja Nai to Yuusha no Party wo Oidasareta node, Henkyou de Slow Life suru Koto ni Shimashita","japanese":"真の仲間じゃないと勇者のパーティーを追い出されたので、辺境でスローライフすることにしました","synonyms":["Banished from the Hero's Party, I Decided to Live a Quiet Life in the Countryside","I Was Kicked out of the Hero's Party Because I Wasn't a True Companion so I Decided to Have a Slow Life at the Frontier","Banished from the Hero's Party, I Decided to Live a Quiet Life in the Countryside, I Was Kicked out of the Hero's Party Because I Wasn't a True Companion so I Decided to Have a Slow Life at the Frontier"],"community":[],"known":["Shin no Nakama ja Nai to Yuusha no Party wo Oidasareta node, Henkyou de Slow Life suru Koto ni Shimashita","Banished From The Hero's Party, I Decided To Live A Quiet Life In The Countryside","真の仲間じゃないと勇者のパーティーを追い出されたので、辺境でスローライフすることにしました","Banished from the Hero's Party, I Decided to Live a Quiet Life in the Countryside","I Was Kicked out of the Hero's Party Because I Wasn't a True Companion so I Decided to Have a Slow Life at the Frontier"]},"synopsis_hebrew":"הרחק מהישג ידם של שדים ומלחמה, בסמוך לארץ הגבול של זולטן, ההרפתקן בדרגה די, רד חי קיום נורמלי. באמצעות התמדה ועבודה קשה, סוף סוף התגשם חלומו להתחיל בית מרקחת משלו וחיים שלווים בכפר. לפתע, רד מקבל בת זוג ועוזרת חיים בשם ריט – נסיכת הדוכסות לוגרוויה והרפתקנית בעצמה – שמוותרת על הכל כדי להצטרף אליו.\nלמרות שהוא ישר, אדיב ואהוב על כולם, לרד יש סוד ששותף רק עם ריט: שמו האמיתי הוא גדעון, אחיה של רותי רגנסון, ה\"גיבור\" וחבר לשעבר בקבוצה. ארס דרובה, ה\"חכם\", העיף את רד מהקבוצה שלהם לאחר מלחמתם נגד אדון השדים לאחר שהחליט שהוא חלש וחסר חשיבות. כעת, למרות שרד עזב את קבוצת הגיבורים מאחור על ידי הנחת חיים חדשים יחד עם ריט, עברו עדיין לא הרפה ממנו.","background_hebrew":null,"type":"TV","episodes":13,"duration_minutes":23,"status":"הסתיים","aired_from":"2021-10-06","season":{"label":"סתיו 2021","year":2021,"season":"fall"},"broadcast":{"label":"רביעי 22:30","day":"wednesday","time":"22:30","timezone":"Asia/Jerusalem"},"categories":[{"en":"Fantasy","he":"פנטזיה"},{"en":"Romance","he":"רומנטיקה"}],"subcategories":[],"demographic":null,"genres":["Fantasy","Romance"],"studios":["Studio Flad","Wolfsbane"],"producers":["AT-X","Nippon Columbia","Kadokawa Media House","BS NTV","Kadokawa","Kyoto Broadcasting System"],"licensors":["Funimation"],"source":null,"rating":null,"scores":{"mal":6.91,"mal_scored_by":195556,"israel":5.25,"israel_scored_by":4,"rank":5430,"popularity":698,"members":402492,"favorites":2133},"community_reviews":{"ratings":4,"written_reviews":0},"images":{"poster":"https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1723/117854l.webp"},"trailer":{"youtube_id":"Q-WDh396OEg","url":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Q-WDh396OEg","embed_url":"https://www.youtube.com/embed/Q-WDh396OEg"},"characters":[{"name":"Rit","role":"ראשי","image":"https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/characters/13/435943.webp?s=753147cb7bc84c003959e3177877800a","voice_actors":[{"name":"Takao, Kanon","language":"יפנית","image":"https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/voiceactors/2/41702.jpg?s=d29c6cd0d184e355e7502b8fa5772dd5"}]},{"name":"Ragnason, Ruti","role":"משני","image":"https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/characters/15/435938.webp?s=2c2bc65ad84166d03a635a6a1ffb7a0e","voice_actors":[{"name":"Oozora, Naomi","language":"יפנית","image":"https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/voiceactors/2/75673.jpg?s=747dfd42c3a666d182a5ff4937ef5084"}]},{"name":"Red","role":"ראשי","image":"https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/characters/15/456265.webp?s=f81b10c6e943ea81df5639348a6643d9","voice_actors":[{"name":"Suzuki,